  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Water and Climate Resilience Technical Assistance and Capacity Support 2019-2024</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Technical Assistance and Capacity Support Investment will support the coordination and management of the WASH Futures Conferences in 2021 and 2023. This Investment will also support: Climate Integration and Programming (CIP) Section water and WASH technical inputs; monitoring and evaluation; representation costs for field visits, conferences and workshops; team capacity building; planning and design costs.</narrative>
  </description>
